Z||000000||Formula 18||12-14-2000||11:09 PM||||Alot of discusion is done on 3800 and I was wondering what type of mounts you guys are using. I have read some sites where up to 3 mounts are used other sites just use on with a dog-bone. WHat is the best way to mount a 3800 to the craddle? I have been following the thread on torque struts for v8 and it seems like some guys running 3800 are saying they need a little extra bracing to controll the torque. Any thoughts?||||reg||1
